# Line endings (P8A, 2026-10-10)
# Keep LF in the repository and in new checkouts so Windows editors stop
# turning source files into CRLF. "text=auto" keeps git's own binary detection,
# and check-in behaves exactly as core.autocrlf=true already does, so no
# existing file needs renormalising and none shows as modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows scripts must stay CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never convert, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
